# Local pilot workspace — synthetic data, never committed.
.pglite/
.objects/
# Any local database or object directory, not just the two default names. The
# defaults alone were not enough: a QA run against .pglite-qa committed 39 MB of
# binary Postgres files, because a rule that lists exact names only protects the
# names someone thought of.
.pglite*/
.objects*/
*.pglite/
backup*.json
